  "details": "<p>Various necropoleis (e.g.,\u00a0<span>Giglio, San Biagio, Castellano, and Collicello)\u00a0</span>attest to settlement activity during the archaic period. The Roman landscapes of this area of the Tiber valley are characterized by\u00a0<em>villae rusticae\u00a0</em>of the late republican and imperial periods.</p>\r\n<p><em>The Barrington Atlas Directory</em> notes: Magliano Sabina</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "Magliano Sabina is located in Lazio, some 50 km north of Rome and some 30 km west of Rieti.",
